  "3": "For each course, a list of the courses that depend on it. All empty at first.",
  "4": "For each course, how many prerequisites it is still waiting for.",
  "5": "The order in which the courses are taken.",
  "8": "Go through each pair: `prereq` must come before `course`.",
  "9": "Record that `course` depends on `prereq`.",
  "10": "`course` now waits for one more prerequisite.",
  "13": "Start a queue with every course that waits for nothing: these can be taken right away.",
  "18": "Repeat while some course is ready to be taken.",
  "19": "Take the next ready course.",
  "20": "Take it now: add it to the order.",
  "21": "Go through the courses that depend on it.",
  "22": "Each of them now waits for one prerequisite fewer.",
  "23": "Is that course now waiting for nothing?",
  "24": "Then it is ready: add it to the queue.",
  "27": "If every course made it into the order, return it. Otherwise some courses are stuck in a circle: return an empty list."
 },
